-    *   **Sample Position:** Compute the sample point $\mathbf{p}$ using jittered linear interpolation:
-        $$ \mathbf{p} = \mathbf{r}_{org} + \text{lerp}(\text{jitter}, t.x, t.y) \cdot \mathbf{r}_{dir} $$
